New design pass — the notes system RFC. Goal: the best, most intuitive notes ever created for screenwriting, on these seven principles: [1] never interrupts writing; [2] anchored to words, not positions; [3] author + role at a glance; [4] real threads, not Re: conventions; [5] Open/Resolved workflow — resolved fades, never deletes; [6] travels inside the FDX both ways, no accounts; [7] one-click notes report PDF. Constraints: every fidelity keep from IL-0024–33 is permanent; no login system ever; Apple-native feel. Sequence: round trip → threads → resolve → range anchors → report export → polish. Write it as docs/RFC-NOTES-SYSTEM.md under a docs-only lock, like RFC-MULTI-CONTAINER-PAGES. Design only, no code.